  "profile": "The technician who repairs the Angel’s wings.\nMechanical maintenance specialist of the Ark Protection Bureau, Aerospace Defense Command, in charge of Bureau Chief Sereniel’s weapons maintenance. Equipped with her all-rounder repair machine, which comes with robotic arms and a tool storage case, there’s nothing that she cannot fix. While upbeat and sunny by nature, her gaze takes on a completely different intensity whenever she’s working.",
